\">BEFORE YOU ARRIVE</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\": 2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">A little<br><em>preparation.</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group \"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Allow extra time for a first appointment. Share any previous lightening, home color, or smoothing treatments, and discuss testing requirements with the salon.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\": \"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"small\">This is an illustrative service page. The salon should confirm its treatment details, appointment lengths, pricing, and policies before publishing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n</section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\": \"section\", \"className\": \"section service-faq\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group section service-faq\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group \"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\": \"eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">A FEW THINGS TO KNOW</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\": 2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Your questions,<br><em>answered.</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"service-faq-list\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group service-faq-list\"><!-- wp:details -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-details\"><summary>Is balayage only for blonde hair?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>No. The technique can create dimension in different shades; suitability depends on your hair and your color goals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</details>\n<!-- /wp:details -->\n<!-- wp:details -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-details\"><summary>How much upkeep does it need?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Placement can support softer grow-out, but toning, trims, and care needs vary. Your colorist can suggest a realistic plan.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</det