paration.</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group \"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Let the salon know your event time and whether you plan to wear accessories or a veil. Ask for preparation instructions; they may differ depending on the style.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\": \"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"small\">This is an illustrative service page. The salon should confirm its treatment details, appointment lengths, pricing, and policies before publishing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n</section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\": \"section\", \"className\": \"section service-faq\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group section service-faq\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group \"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\": \"eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">A FEW THINGS TO KNOW</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\": 2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Your questions,<br><em>answered.</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"service-faq-list\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group service-faq-list\"><!-- wp:details -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-details\"><summary>Should I wash my hair beforehand?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ask your stylist for preparation instructions. The answer depends on your hair and the planned look.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</details>\n<!-- /wp:details -->\n<!-- wp:details -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-details\"><summary>Can I book a trial?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Discuss a trial when you enquire, especially for an important occasion or a more detailed style.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</details>\n<!-- /wp:details -->\n<!-- wp:details -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-details\"><summary>Do you offer group or bridal bookings?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Contact the salon directly to confirm their availability, services, and any arrangements for groups.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</details>\n<!-- /wp:details -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n</section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\": \"section\", \"className\": \"section related-services\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group section related-services\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"section-title horizontal\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group section-title horizontal\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\": 2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Continue<br><em>exploring.</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\": \"link-paragraph\"} -->\n<p class=\"link-paragraph\"><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"{{page:services}}\">The complete service edit ↗</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"related-grid\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group related-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"related-service\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group related-service\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\": \"eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">THE ATELIER MENU</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\": 3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cut &amp; finish</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For a maintenance trim, a fresh shape, or a change you’ve been considering.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\": \"link-paragraph\"} -->\n<p class=\"link-paragraph\"><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"{{page:cut-finish}}\">Discover this service ↗</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"related-service\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group related-service\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\": \"eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">THE ATELIER MENU</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\": 3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Color &amp; gloss</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For a tonal refresh, added depth, or a personalized color plan.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\": \"link-paragraph\"} -->\n<p class=\"link-paragraph\"><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"{{page:color-gloss}}\">Discover this service ↗</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"related-service\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group related-service\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\": \"eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">THE ATELIER MENU</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\": 3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Balayage</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For softly blended dimension, brightness around the face, or a gradual move toward lighter hair.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\": \"link-paragraph\"} -->\n<p class=\"link-paragraph\"><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"{{page:balayage}}\">Discover this service ↗</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n</section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\": \"section\", \"className\": \"section cta-strip\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group section cta-strip\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group \"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\": \"eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">A MOMENT, JUST FOR YOU</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\": 2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Ready for your<br><em>next chapter?</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\": \"link-paragraph\"} -->\n<p class=\"link-paragraph\"><a class=\"button\" href=\"{{page:book-appointment}}\">Request an appointment ↗</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n"], "consultation": ["Consultation", "<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\": \"section\", \"className\": \"section service-detail-hero\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group section service-detail-hero\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"service-detail-intro\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group service-detail-intro\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\": \"eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">THE ATELIER MENU / CONSULTATION</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\": 2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Good hair begins<br>with <em>a conversation.</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\": \"service-detail-lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"service-detail-lead\">A little time to ask questions, explore possibilities, and build a plan. A consultation is a thoughtful first step when you are considering a change.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"service-facts\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group service-facts\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group \"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\": \"eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">APPOINTMENT</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>20 min</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group \"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\": \"eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">PRICING</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Confirmed by the salon</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\": \"link-paragraph\"} -->\n<p class=\"link-paragraph\"><a class=\"button\" href=\"{{page:book-appointment}}\">Request this service ↗</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\": \"link-paragraph\"} -->\n<p class=\"link-paragraph\"><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"{{page:services}}\">← Back to all services</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"service-detail-image\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group service-detail-image\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\": \"full\", \"linkDestination\": \"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"{{asset:salon}}\" alt=\"Illustrative salon portrait; replace with your own business photograph\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n</section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\": \"section\", \"className\": \"section service-experience\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group section service-experience\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"section-title\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group section-title\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\": \"eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">WHAT TO EXPECT</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\": 2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Your visit,<br><em>considered.</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For a new look, a color change, an unfamiliar service, or a second opinion on your options.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"ritual-grid\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ritual-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"ritual-step\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ritual-step\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\": \"service-number\"} -->\n<p class=\"service-number\">01</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\": 3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Share</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tell us about your routine, recent services, and what you would like to change.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"ritual-step\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ritual-step\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\": \"service-number\"} -->\n<p class=\"service-number\">02</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\": 3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Explore</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We discuss suitable approaches, realistic results, and the maintenance involved.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\": \"ritual-step\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ritual-step\